  "description": {
    "text": "Five cards drawn by children: the winning entries of the Kids' WB! Poké Card Creator Contest. Entrants aged five to fifteen drew one of five chosen Pokémon and sent their picture in between 16 February and 10 April 2004, and Pokémon USA made new cards of Treecko, Wurmple, Torchic, Mudkip and Pikachu from the winning pictures.\n\n5,250 packs went out in July 2004: 50 to each of the five grand prize winners and one to each of 5,000 first prize winners. The pack is a foil pouch like a booster pack. The cards were released only in English and are not legal in tournaments.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Poké Card Creator Pack (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 20 May 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260520201857/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Pok%C3%A9_Card_Creator_Pack_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"WB\" symbol, a NOT TOURNAMENT LEGAL line, and a number out of 5",
    "sources": [
